{
  "story": "S2-014",
  "description": "Questions unrelated to the active reviews (general knowledge, current events, coding, math, recommendations elsewhere). They must be declined; the controls must still be answered, including review questions whose topic sounds general and a question that mixes a review question with an unrelated one.",
